{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc 'git diff 7e40761d11e4dae80fdaad4b633518a524596716..f2f64a0fd59e34007bdaf71d465494a74544023a -- .pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json .pose/changelogs/unreleased/pose-generation-bound-query-cursors.md'","aggregated_output":"diff --git a/.pose/changelogs/unreleased/pose-generation-bound-query-cursors.md b/.pose/changelogs/unreleased/pose-generation-bound-query-cursors.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 00000000..f12f6827\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.pose/changelogs/unreleased/pose-generation-bound-query-cursors.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+---\n+spec: pose-generation-bound-query-cursors\n+category: changed\n+breaking: false\n+---\n+\n+Paginated MCP list tools continue a query over the collection it was issued\n+for. A cursor is now signed and bound to its tool, project, filters and the\n+ordered collection (with its index generation); a collection that changed\n+between pages, another query, an expired token or a server restart is refused\n+with a `cursor-*` code and the caller restarts from the first page, instead of\n+silently skipping or repeating items. Version 1 cursors are refused, a page is\n+at most 500 items, and each page discloses its generation and collection. Calls\n+without cursor and limit are unchanged.\ndiff --git a/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json b/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\nindex 18e73cbb..f8d5413c 100644\n--- a/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\n+++ b/.pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\n@@ -2581,6 +2581,20 @@\n           ],\n           \"severity\": \"required\",\n           \"evidenceClass\": \"integration\"\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"name\": \"generation-bound-query-cursors-integration\",\n+          \"program\": \"go\",\n+          \"args\": [\n+            \"test\",\n+            \"./internal/pose\",\n+            \"./internal/mcpserver\",\n+            \"-run\",\n+            \"PageByGeneration|ACursor|HostileCursor|ExpiredCursor|APositionOutside|AContinuation|AnIssuedCursor|EveryPage|PageLimitIsBounded|EquivalentFilters|APageStates|APageCarries|PageCost|DoesNotReverify|SymlinkTarget|PreservesSizeAndModTime|NullCursor|FiltersThatSerialize|ACursorAlias|OmittedSort|AnAlias|AnExplicit|Pagination|ListToolsShareThePaginationSchema\",\n+            \"-count=1\"\n+          ],\n+          \"severity\": \"required\",\n+          \"evidenceClass\": \"integration\"\n         }\n       ]\n     },\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
